    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the solution curve of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to",
